{"term":{"label":"親","occurrences":12,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"3A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i","title":"滕文公上","description":"滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"下","id":"下"},{"form":"事","id":"事"},{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"喪","id":"喪"},{"form":"夷子","id":"夷子"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"小","id":"小"},{"form":"年","id":"年"},{"form":"易","id":"易"},{"form":"民","id":"民"},{"form":"父","id":"父"},{"form":"百","id":"百"},{"form":"聞","id":"聞"},{"form":"自","id":"自"},{"form":"親","id":"親"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.6855773452501515,"source":"年","target":"喪"},{"weight":1.1169614273363062,"source":"年","target":"事"},{"weight":0.6574290979578661,"source":"年","target":"子"},{"weight":1.4423838277709342,"source":"易","target":"百"},{"weight":1.2347444629926896,"source":"易","target":"下"},{"weight":1.927891643552635,"source":"易","target":"夷子"},{"weight":1.3862943611198906,"source":"喪","target":"自"},{"weight":1.586965056582042,"source":"喪","target":"親"},{"weight":1.3246007921145506,"source":"仁","target":"人"},{"weight":1.0369187196627698,"source":"仁","target":"民"},{"weight":1.3505762785178115,"source":"仁","target":"子"},{"weight":1.2039728043259361,"source":"仁","target":"自"},{"weight":1.8101086078962514,"source":"仁","target":"聞"},{"weight":0.8292793548845252,"source":"仁","target":"下"},{"weight":1.4046434997880872,"source":"仁","target":"親"},{"weight":0.34377153910282454,"source":"民","target":"事"},{"weight":0.26372883142928805,"source":"民","target":"人"},{"weight":1.7300659002227152,"source":"民","target":"父"},{"weight":0.05608946665104358,"source":"民","target":"下"},{"weight":1.2192402764567245,"source":"民","target":"小"},{"weight":0.6314536115546054,"source":"民","target":"親"},{"weight":0.43078291609245434,"source":"民","target":"自"},{"weight":0.798507